Q: C# htmlnode cant get tr inside tbody A: <p>What does</p>
<pre><code>var table = doc.DocumentNode.SelectSingleNode(&quot;//ps-table[@id='test1']//table&quot;);
Console.WriteLine(table?.OuterHtml);
